          "title": "PRISM: A Predictive Protocol for Permutation Optimization via Landscape Diagnostics",
          "title_zh": "PRISM：通过景观诊断进行排列优化的预测协议",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.08344v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.08344",
          "summary": "PRISM measures a fitness landscape with inexpensive diagnostics such as one-step move autocorrelation and fitness-distance correlation before selecting a search strategy for permutation optimization. It is tested on synthetic permutation landscapes, neural architecture benchmarks, scientific machine learning pipelines, and LLM instruction ordering to predict when structured search is likely to beat random sampling.",
